(b) A^5 \left[\begin{array}{c}
838\cr
172
\end{array}\right] = \left[\begin{array}{cc}
0.85 \amp 0.48\cr
0.15 \amp 0.52
\end{array}\right]^5 \left[\begin{array}{c}
838\cr
172
\end{array}\right] = \left[\begin{array}{c}
769.999\cr
240.001
\end{array}\right], so the 770 employees will be at work five days from now.

